      ],
      "en": "twenty bowls of gold weighing one thousand darics, and two vessels of fine bright bronze, precious as gold.",
      "ko": "또 금잔이 이십개라 중수는 일천 다릭이요 또 아름답고 빛나 금 같이 보배로운 놋그릇이 두개라",
      "source_text_hash": "64f556c04b1ee8765df505c871bacc05b42a5ee57b3cba2aa7fce9ef81b9fde0",
      "translation_text_hash": "0d2bc34b649f705fdf06628e2afbfb1275006c20789b7a88a7c4c14960b891fa",
