      "en": "We came to Jerusalem, and stayed there three days.",
      "ko": "이에 예루살렘에 이르러 거기서 삼일을 유하고",
      "source_text_hash": "4ded27990b107e5711ae1a30670b370ffc528c4d3501e857a48b3e5f8af45a70",
      "translation_text_hash": "524834d7e26ef0bac3844e210086458e432197bc8f72e32a60f7566114a46f52",
