      "en": "Everything was counted and weighed; and all the weight was written at that time.",
      "ko": "모든 것을 다 계수하고 달아보고 그 중수를 당장에 책에 기록하였느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "cc8ffbe43e1351b76e51daca457b28111e9601e74c9fd897db0dc12b3a03df53",
      "translation_text_hash": "61ab48cc56f6e045b96a2af706e52f27bb6d58ab04c0cb89e333bc77fca1ccd7",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
